Dialogue: 10,0:00:05.13,0:00:07.34,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku sudah sehat!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:07.88,0:00:09.67,dialog,,0,0,0,,Terima kasih, Dok.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:09.76,0:00:12.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau selalu pulih dengan cepat.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:12.48,0:00:13.69,dialog,,0,0,0,,Byobugaura!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:13.97,0:00:15.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Terima kasih banyak, ya!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:15.72,0:00:16.72,dialog,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:22.64,0:00:24.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sakit.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:24.44,0:00:25.86,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kakak?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:27.29,0:00:30.54,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pantas saja jempolku masih belum sembuh.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:30.83,0:00:32.21,dialog,,0,0,0,,Keren!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:32.24,0:00:34.11,dialog,,0,0,0,,Seperti inikah sifat kakakmu?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:37.70,0:00:38.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:38.95,0:00:40.37,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kakakmu juga bisa membuat tangan?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:42.80,0:00:44.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,Keren sekali.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:45.67,0:00:46.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,Waw!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:46.63,0:00:48.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,K-Kakak?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:48.92,0:00:52.84,dialog,,0,0,0,,Menarik sekali.\NDarah yang memiliki kesadaran sendiri.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:54.84,0:00:56.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dinginnya.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:00.14,0:01:02.40,dialog,,0,0,0,,Posisi kita cukup tinggi.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:03.69,0:01:05.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apakah mereka baik-baik saja?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:37.99,0:02:40.28,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sudah kubilang...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:40.57,0:02:41.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,Siapa kau sebenarnya?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:43.74,0:02:45.91,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tentu saja ini aku, Kiriyama Rokuro.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:46.16,0:02:47.82,dialog,,0,0,0,,Rokuro yang kukenal adalah
Dialogue: 10,0:02:47.85,0:02:51.64,dialog,,0,0,0,,pecundang tak berguna dan menyedihkan\Nyang tak berdaya tanpa diriku.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:51.67,0:02:53.17,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kejamnya.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:54.72,0:02:56.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku bukan orang seperti itu.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:58.27,0:02:59.78,dialog,,0,0,0,,Rokuro!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:00.32,0:03:02.32,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sekujur tubuhku terasa sakit.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:02.59,0:03:04.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu efek samping\Ndari Teknik Gerhana Darah milikmu.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:04.92,0:03:07.23,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tolong! Panggil ambulans!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:07.25,0:03:09.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bukan, panggil ambulans udara!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:09.48,0:03:10.91,dialog,,0,0,0,,Astaga, kau ngotot tak mau mati!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:10.93,0:03:12.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak salah juga, sih.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:12.81,0:03:15.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,Benar. Itulah Rokuro yang kukenal.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:16.86,0:03:18.78,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jadwalkan MRI untukku.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:18.80,0:03:21.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Atau setidaknya CT scan.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:21.70,0:03:24.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,Rokuro, kau payah sekali.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:26.59,0:03:28.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:28.07,0:03:29.66,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku payah?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:32.50,0:03:33.42,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak bisa.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:33.49,0:03:36.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jadi, menyebutnya payah\Nmalah membuatnya bersemangat.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:36.63,0:03:38.32,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hei!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:38.92,0:03:39.84,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hei!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:39.88,0:03:41.09,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu Shiki.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:41.51,0:03:43.56,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sedikit lagi kalian sampai di puncak.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:43.99,0:03:46.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Semangat!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:46.28,0:03:47.82,dialog,,0,0,0,,Terima kasih!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:00.32,0:04:01.51,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lepaskan aku!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:02.45,0:04:04.16,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ke mana perginya bajingan itu?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:04.42,0:04:06.09,dialog,,0,0,0,,Si Pengajar Kucing?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:06.20,0:04:07.37,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kita berhasil kabur darinya.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:08.94,0:04:11.67,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kenapa kau menghalangiku?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:11.70,0:04:13.99,dialog,,0,0,0,,Menghalangi?\NJustru kau yang memperlambat kami.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:14.66,0:04:16.83,dialog,,0,0,0,,Entah apa alasanmu bersikap\Ngegabah seperti itu,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:16.91,0:04:19.54,dialog,,0,0,0,,tapi sikapmu yang seenak jidat itu\Nsungguh menyebalkan.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:19.84,0:04:22.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Siapa bilang aku gegabah?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:22.31,0:04:24.08,dialog,,0,0,0,,Semua juga tahu itu.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:25.34,0:04:29.09,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau pikir latihan ecek-ecek ini\Nbisa membuat kita makin kuat?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:32.11,0:04:33.32,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sial!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:33.65,0:04:36.69,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kaki yang ditusuk Pengajar Kucing itu\Nmasih belum sembuh, ya?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:36.72,0:04:37.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Diam!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:39.47,0:04:42.14,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau jadi makin lembek.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:42.64,0:04:44.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Padahal dulu kau lebih beringas,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:44.99,0:04:48.29,dialog,,0,0,0,,tapi sepertinya kehadiran teman\Nmembuatmu jadi melunak, ya?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:49.32,0:04:51.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,Menyedihkan.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:01.00,0:05:04.42,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mereka memang masih menyebalkan.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:06.20,0:05:09.79,dialog,,0,0,0,,Namun, aku tidak keberatan.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:10.75,0:05:13.67,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau menurutmu itu lembek, silakan saja.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:16.65,0:05:18.44,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa maksud ucapannya?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:19.98,0:05:21.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kita cuma buang-buang waktu.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:23.21,0:05:24.21,dialog,,0,0,0,,Awas di belakangmu!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:31.73,0:05:34.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia juga bisa berubah menjadi benda mati?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:36.04,0:05:37.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bagaimana kondisimu, Nak?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:37.91,0:05:40.66,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sekarang lengan kanan dan kakimu\Nsama-sama tak berfungsi.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:41.14,0:05:42.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,Berengsek.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:42.22,0:05:44.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku sudah tak bisa membuat senjata.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:44.59,0:05:46.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,Teknik Gerhana Darah!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:47.11,0:05:48.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,Akulah lawanmu dalam duel ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:49.05,0:05:50.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa kau yakin?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:59.62,0:06:01.44,dialog,,0,0,0,,Anak muda...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:01.62,0:06:03.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Saatnya menghadapi situasi yang sulit.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:05.92,0:06:07.59,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tenang saja.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:07.61,0:06:10.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Selama kalian memiliki kemauan\Nuntuk mengatasi setiap rintangan,
Dialogue: 10,0:06:10.98,0:06:13.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,hati kalian akan terus bergelora!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:14.88,0:06:16.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Wah, semangat sekali dia.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:18.15,0:06:19.71,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini benar-benar gawat.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:20.37,0:06:22.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kami bertemu keduanya sekaligus.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:23.49,0:06:25.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kami terpaksa kabur.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:32.25,0:06:35.35,dialog,,0,0,0,,Gawat. Mereka bertemu kedua guru.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:35.52,0:06:36.81,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa rencana kita?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:37.34,0:06:38.67,dialog,,0,0,0,,Yusurube.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:39.30,0:06:41.54,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tolong bantu aku.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:45.05,0:06:46.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kami harus bagaimana?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:46.75,0:06:49.11,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kami harus melakukan sesuatu.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:54.44,0:06:58.11,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tembok di hadapan kalian mungkin tinggi.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:58.50,0:07:00.21,dialog,,0,0,0,,Maka, jadilah burung!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:00.23,0:07:01.82,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jangan takut pada tembok!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:02.95,0:07:05.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sekaranglah saatnya untuk terbang!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:05.05,0:07:07.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau ini bicara apa? Dasar gila.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:07.31,0:07:08.64,dialog,,0,0,0,,Wah.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:09.14,0:07:11.27,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lihat dirimu.\NSemua ucapan sombongmu sebelumnya
Dialogue: 10,0:07:11.29,0:07:13.68,dialog,,0,0,0,,pasti terasa cukup memalukan sekarang.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:13.96,0:07:15.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa kau bilang?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:16.64,0:07:21.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bagaimana kalau kulempar kau\Nkembali ke garis awal?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:22.42,0:07:23.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,Celaka.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:29.57,0:07:32.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa? Tanganku meledak?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:33.30,0:07:35.51,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak mungkin.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:35.67,0:07:38.86,dialog,,0,0,0,,Di tengah badai salju ini,\Njarak mereka sekitar lima kilometer.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:38.89,0:07:42.27,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jarak pandangnya sangat buruk.\NMustahil tembakan itu berasal dari sana.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:42.71,0:07:45.37,dialog,,0,0,0,,Menembak jitu dari jarak sejauh itu,
Dialogue: 10,0:07:45.44,0:07:46.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,tak ada yang bisa melakukannya.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:48.70,0:07:50.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau ada yang bisa, berarti dia luar biasa!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:51.98,0:07:53.19,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oke.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:53.75,0:07:57.67,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sekarang dia jauh lebih mahir\Ndalam mengendalikan darahnya.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:58.25,0:07:59.26,dialog,,0,0,0,,Yusurube.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:00.23,0:08:01.86,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tolong bantu aku.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:07.07,0:08:08.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bayangkan detailnya.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:09.28,0:08:11.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,Setiap detailnya...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:12.12,0:08:16.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bukan senjata yang besar dan kuat\Nseperti sebelumnya.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:16.54,0:08:19.21,dialog,,0,0,0,,Senjata yang mampu mengenai sasaran\Nyang jauh dengan tepat.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:22.83,0:08:23.83,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sip.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:24.86,0:08:26.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,Berhasil.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:29.55,0:08:31.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Yusurube, beri tahu posisi mereka!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:32.03,0:08:33.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,Siap!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:36.08,0:08:38.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,Di depan, agak ke kiri.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:40.11,0:08:41.78,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tak bisa melihat apa pun.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:44.40,0:08:45.65,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sudah ketemu.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:49.65,0:08:52.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sekarang dia jauh lebih berkembang\Ndaripada semasa di Kyoto dulu.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:54.37,0:08:58.49,dialog,,0,0,0,,Perlu latihan serius untuk meningkatkan\Nketepatan benda yang dibuat dari darah.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:59.83,0:09:01.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia menyerap semuanya seperti spons.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:03.84,0:09:06.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pertarungannya dengan Mikado\Njelas sangat membekas padanya.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:07.29,0:09:10.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sial! Hentakan tembakan barusan\Nmembuyarkan bidikanku.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:10.57,0:09:13.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,Yusurube, infokan lagi posisi mereka.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:13.41,0:09:15.37,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sedikit bergeser ke kiri.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:15.46,0:09:17.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kiri. Kiri.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:17.71,0:09:18.92,dialog,,0,0,0,,Di situ!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:19.17,0:09:22.17,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tadi lebih mudah membidik\Nkarena tangan Innami terlihat,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:22.30,0:09:24.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,tapi sekarang aku tak tahu\Nyang mana para guru!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:24.76,0:09:26.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,Seberapa banyak yang bisa kau lihat?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:26.41,0:09:29.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hanya siluet manusia.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:29.07,0:09:30.78,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dua di depan adalah guru!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:30.80,0:09:32.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau bisa melihat wajah mereka?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:32.56,0:09:33.56,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:33.77,0:09:38.96,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi berkat latihan, kini aku bisa melihat\Nkondisi mental orang dalam bentuk warna.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:39.73,0:09:42.61,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dua orang di belakang memancarkan\Nnuansa cemas dan terburu-buru.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:43.48,0:09:46.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dua orang di depan tampak kaget,\Ntapi tetap tenang.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:47.04,0:09:48.79,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jadi, dua orang di depan adalah guru.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:48.88,0:09:50.01,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hebat!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:50.50,0:09:52.84,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau aku terus melatih akurasiku\Nsepesat ini,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:52.95,0:09:55.37,dialog,,0,0,0,,aku juga akan bisa melihat wajah\Ndan tubuh mereka.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:55.49,0:09:56.83,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dengan kata lain,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:56.98,0:10:01.28,dialog,,0,0,0,,aku bisa mengintip\Ndi tempat mana pun yang kumau!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:01.64,0:10:04.69,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kekuatan itu jatuh ke tangan orang\Nyang paling bejat.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:07.50,0:10:10.17,dialog,,0,0,0,,Homare, bisakah kau singkirkan kakakmu?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:13.83,0:10:15.37,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kenapa...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:18.07,0:10:19.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kenapa aku...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:20.50,0:10:23.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sungguh insting yang mengagumkan!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:23.24,0:10:26.56,dialog,,0,0,0,,Juga tekad untuk membantu\Nteman-temanmu dari kejauhan.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:26.58,0:10:28.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau bertindak tanpa ragu! Luar biasa!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:28.50,0:10:31.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau pantas kupuji "Good"!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:31.73,0:10:33.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:33.71,0:10:35.42,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu mungkin Shiki.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:36.35,0:10:39.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sial, anak itu sungguh menjengkelkan.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:40.24,0:10:41.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ayo kita kabur mumpung ada kesempatan!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:43.02,0:10:44.27,dialog,,0,0,0,,Takkan kubiarkan.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:53.27,0:10:54.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tak akan kubiarkan begitu saja.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:55.22,0:10:59.39,dialog,,0,0,0,,Di ruang terbuka seperti ini,\Naku sangat tidak diuntungkan.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:59.50,0:11:01.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,Keputusan cerdas.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:01.95,0:11:03.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kaki mereka berdua terluka.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:04.27,0:11:07.61,dialog,,0,0,0,,Waspadai penembak jitu,\Njangan sampai mereka lolos!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:12.58,0:11:15.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,Satu-satunya cara untuk kabur\Ntanpa melukai kaki kami lebih parah adalah...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:15.63,0:11:17.19,dialog,,0,0,0,,ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:22.78,0:11:23.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lepaskan aku, Berengsek!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:23.97,0:11:25.49,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jangan harap!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:25.51,0:11:26.52,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalian tak akan bisa lolos!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:34.66,0:11:37.52,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bocah sialan itu!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:37.79,0:11:41.41,dialog,,0,0,0,,Andai aku bisa langsung menyerang ke puncak,\Nini pasti lebih mudah.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:41.78,0:11:45.08,dialog,,0,0,0,,Anak sialan itu terus menembaki kami.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:45.12,0:11:48.21,dialog,,0,0,0,,Akan kuhabisi XXX, kurobek XXX miliknya,
Dialogue: 10,0:11:48.24,0:11:50.14,dialog,,0,0,0,,lalu kujejalkan ke bagian XXX!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:50.29,0:11:53.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jarak mereka sudah sejauh itu.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:53.09,0:11:55.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kecepatan yang luar biasa.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:55.31,0:11:56.31,dialog,,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:57.17,0:11:59.17,dialog,,0,0,0,,Akan kutangkap mereka.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:59.38,0:12:00.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau begitu, aku duluan.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:00.41,0:12:02.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tak usah. Kau lambat.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:05.27,0:12:08.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,Takkan kubiarkan mereka sampai di tujuan!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:12.54,0:12:14.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tunggu aku, Keparat!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:23.37,0:12:24.99,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dari sini, daki sendiri!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:25.21,0:12:26.34,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jangan mengaturku!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:34.11,0:12:36.28,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku dan kakakku akan membantu kalian naik.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:36.31,0:12:38.72,dialog,,0,0,0,,Wah! Ada yang sedang percaya diri!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:38.76,0:12:41.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itulah hebatnya Byobugaura bersaudari.\NSingkatnya, B.S.!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:42.32,0:12:44.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ayo, Kak!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:48.59,0:12:49.59,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lo?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:51.04,0:12:54.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,Eh? Kakak kekurangan darah\Nuntuk berubah menjadi raksasa?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:55.42,0:12:56.92,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau bisa mengobrol dengan kakakmu?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:57.31,0:13:03.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tak bisa membantu di saat genting!\NMaafkan aku karena telah hidup.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:03.07,0:13:04.91,dialog,,0,0,0,,Perubahan suasana hatimu terlalu ekstrem!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:07.62,0:13:09.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aduh!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:12.08,0:13:14.46,dialog,,0,0,0,,"Jangan gampang putus asa"?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:14.50,0:13:17.17,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi tak perlu sampai menggigit pantatku.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:17.21,0:13:18.26,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kakak.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:19.51,0:13:20.84,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bisakah kau jelaskan
Dialogue: 10,0:13:22.84,0:13:27.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,rasanya menggigit pantat Homare?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:31.65,0:13:34.32,dialog,,0,0,0,,Maaf, aku tak bisa membantu.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:34.34,0:13:36.84,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sudah kubilang, tak masalah!\NSerahkan saja padaku!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:37.15,0:13:40.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jarak mereka sudah cukup jauh\Ndari kedua guru itu.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:42.57,0:13:44.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sekarang, waktunya aku menggila.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:51.18,0:13:54.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,Anak muda, ujian baru telah menanti.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:02.25,0:14:04.26,dialog,,0,0,0,,Akan kuserang mereka saat sedang memanjat.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:12.06,0:14:15.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pertarungan yang sengit.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:16.58,0:14:19.84,dialog,,0,0,0,,Meski sekarat, dia masih bisa melawan.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:29.85,0:14:31.56,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini menyedihkan.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:31.60,0:14:32.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jangankan menghentikan mereka.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:33.00,0:14:34.59,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mengejar saja tak sanggup.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:36.10,0:14:38.52,dialog,,0,0,0,,Semua orang sudah berusaha keras.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:38.86,0:14:40.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau pun sama.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:41.09,0:14:42.34,dialog,,0,0,0,,Demi bertahan hidup.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:47.27,0:14:48.27,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hm.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:52.63,0:14:53.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kougasaki.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:54.30,0:14:55.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:56.15,0:14:57.81,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bagus, berhasil naik!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:58.56,0:15:00.19,dialog,,0,0,0,,Syukurlah kau tak apa.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:00.38,0:15:02.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,Yaoroshi, raih tanganku!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:15.79,0:15:17.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Minggir sana.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:21.21,0:15:23.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ada masalah apa dia?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:39.38,0:15:41.88,dialog,,0,0,0,,8 jam 48 menit.\NSemua orang berhasil mencapai tujuan.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:42.42,0:15:44.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sedikit lebih cepat dari perkiraan.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:45.31,0:15:46.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bagus.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:47.14,0:15:49.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ada yang berkembang dalam latihan ini,
Dialogue: 10,0:15:50.17,0:15:52.43,dialog,,0,0,0,,ada yang mempelajari perannya,
Dialogue: 10,0:15:53.18,0:15:56.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,ada yang menilai situasi\Ndan mengambil keputusan,
Dialogue: 10,0:15:56.79,0:15:58.75,dialog,,0,0,0,,ada pula yang belajar bekerja sama.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:59.05,0:16:00.88,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalian semua sudah mulai memahami
Dialogue: 10,0:16:00.99,0:16:04.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,cara kerja individu dan tim\Nsaat beroperasi di lapangan.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:05.78,0:16:07.16,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lalu, Yaoroshi,
Dialogue: 10,0:16:08.53,0:16:09.83,dialog,,0,0,0,,kau juga sudah bagus.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:11.23,0:16:15.34,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau menunjukkan pada semua orang\Napa yang akan terjadi
Dialogue: 10,0:16:15.89,0:16:18.40,dialog,,0,0,0,,ketika salah satu anggota tim bersikap egois.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:19.05,0:16:21.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau buang-buang waktu sepanjang latihan ini,
Dialogue: 10,0:16:21.47,0:16:24.34,dialog,,0,0,0,,tetapi dalam hal itu, kau layak dipuji.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:24.83,0:16:28.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau mau cari gara-gara?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:28.55,0:16:32.34,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sejak awal aturan "semua orang mencapai\Ntujuan bersama-sama" itu membuatku kesal!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:32.45,0:16:34.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku ingin menjadi kuat dengan caraku.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:34.77,0:16:36.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa yang lebih penting daripada itu?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:36.41,0:16:38.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,Saling akrab dan bekerja sebagai sebuah tim?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:38.83,0:16:39.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Benar.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:40.21,0:16:41.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ha?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:42.30,0:16:46.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Menemukan rekan yang berarti bagimu\Nadalah salah satu tujuan Akademi Rasetsu.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:49.18,0:16:51.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pada dasarnya, Oni memiliki kemampuan\Nfisik yang jauh melampaui manusia.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:51.97,0:16:54.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jadi, apa artinya bagi seorang\NOni untuk menjadi makin kuat?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:55.49,0:16:57.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Artinya, meningkatkan kontrol atas darahmu
Dialogue: 10,0:16:57.10,0:16:58.99,dialog,,0,0,0,,dan memperluas berbagai teknikmu.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:00.74,0:17:05.49,dialog,,0,0,0,,Darah seorang Oni sangat terkait\Ndengan kekuatan mental
Dialogue: 10,0:17:05.76,0:17:07.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,atau dengan kata lain, hati.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:08.10,0:17:10.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dengan memelihara hatimu,\Nkau akan menjadi Oni yang lebih kuat.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:10.73,0:17:14.19,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dan tak ada yang lebih penting dalam\Nmemelihara hati selain kebersamaan.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:15.04,0:17:18.88,dialog,,0,0,0,,Keinginan untuk membantu atau melindungi\Ndan kesadaran bahwa kau tidak sendirian.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:19.60,0:17:21.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Perasaan semacam itu menguatkan hati
Dialogue: 10,0:17:21.95,0:17:24.66,dialog,,0,0,0,,dan membuka kekuatan penuh darah Oni.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:28.54,0:17:31.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku ingin menyelamatkan Ichinose!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:31.96,0:17:33.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia benar.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:34.30,0:17:37.14,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kemarahan dan dendam juga dapat\Nmembuat darahmu jadi lebih kuat,
Dialogue: 10,0:17:37.30,0:17:39.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,tetapi itu berisiko memicu\Namukan yang tak terkendali.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:39.32,0:17:40.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dan parahnya lagi,
Dialogue: 10,0:17:40.26,0:17:41.96,dialog,,0,0,0,,rasa marah dan dendam dapat\Nmenguras darah lebih cepat.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:42.31,0:17:44.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mengamuk mungkin memberimu\Nlonjakan kekuatan sementara,
Dialogue: 10,0:17:45.23,0:17:47.81,dialog,,0,0,0,,tetapi kehilangan darah\Nakan segera membuatmu pingsan.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:48.52,0:17:50.19,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kemarahan dan dendam punya cara kerja serupa.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:50.67,0:17:53.01,dialog,,0,0,0,,Darah kalian akan cepat habis.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:53.79,0:17:57.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Menjaga hati kalian\Ndan membiarkannya berkembang
Dialogue: 10,0:17:57.51,0:17:59.34,dialog,,0,0,0,,akan membuat kalian jadi jauh lebih kuat.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:00.07,0:18:02.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,Makanya kalian memerlukan rekan.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:03.57,0:18:07.32,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tentu saja,\Nkondisi fisik dan latihan juga penting.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:07.63,0:18:13.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,Namun, intinya, yang terpenting\Nadalah memelihara hati kalian.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:13.78,0:18:16.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dan tetap bersikap tenang.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:16.66,0:18:19.86,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sadar, tidak,\Nada berapa banyak orang di Agensi Oni
Dialogue: 10,0:18:19.89,0:18:22.31,dialog,,0,0,0,,yang tampak tenang dan santai?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:22.54,0:18:24.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,Setelah kupikir-pikir...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:24.93,0:18:27.44,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa lihat-lihat? Kubunuh kau.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:27.46,0:18:28.88,dialog,,0,0,0,,Wah, santai.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:29.63,0:18:32.07,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jalin ikatan dengan orang lain\Ndan berjuanglah bersama mereka.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:32.37,0:18:36.09,dialog,,0,0,0,,Akademi Rasetsu juga merupakan\Ntempat untuk memelihara hati kalian.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:36.59,0:18:40.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,Latihan ini dirancang untuk tujuan tersebut.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:41.49,0:18:43.99,dialog,,0,0,0,,Setelah dijelaskan, rasanya masuk akal.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:44.26,0:18:47.14,dialog,,0,0,0,,Untuk menjalin ikatan,\Nkalian harus saling memahami dahulu.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:47.75,0:18:49.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Shiki.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:49.33,0:18:50.71,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa tujuanmu?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:50.83,0:18:52.14,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku? Kok tiba-tiba begitu?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:53.09,0:18:54.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku
Dialogue: 10,0:18:55.11,0:18:56.86,dialog,,0,0,0,,akan membalaskan dendam ayahku.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:00.34,0:19:01.35,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lalu,
Dialogue: 10,0:19:01.83,0:19:05.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,menciptakan dunia tempat para Oni\Nbisa tertawa dan hidup normal.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:06.27,0:19:08.52,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kougasaki, kalau kau?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:08.90,0:19:10.65,dialog,,0,0,0,,Membunuh ayahku.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:11.98,0:19:13.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,Byobugaura.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:13.54,0:19:18.72,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku ingin makin mahir\Nmengendalikan darahku agar bisa berguna.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:20.18,0:19:21.43,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sazanami?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:23.69,0:19:26.44,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku ingin dimakamkan bersama Rokuro.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:26.52,0:19:27.88,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa? Dimakamkan?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:27.93,0:19:29.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tentu saja, Rokuro yang dimakamkan duluan.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:30.25,0:19:31.17,dialog,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:31.19,0:19:32.19,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kiriyama.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:33.34,0:19:34.69,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku ingin menjadi keren.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:34.71,0:19:36.92,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau juga ingin dimakamkan bersamaku, 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:37.01,0:19:39.26,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bukan itu yang kuinginkan.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:40.07,0:19:41.07,dialog,,0,0,0,,Yusurube?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:44.51,0:19:45.51,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:47.21,0:19:49.46,dialog,,0,0,0,,kencan berseragam sekolah.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:49.67,0:19:51.63,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Ini urusan yang sangat penting.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:51.73,0:19:56.02,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Untuk sepenuhnya menikmati\Nkencan berseragam sekolah, dunia harus damai.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:56.10,0:19:59.39,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Dengan kata lain, jika perang antara\NOni dan Momotaro belum berakhir,
Dialogue: 10,0:19:59.42,0:20:01.21,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,impianku tak bisa terwujud.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:02.54,0:20:05.46,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itulah yang kuperjuangkan.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:09.91,0:20:10.91,dialog,,0,0,0,,Yaoroshi?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:11.12,0:20:12.12,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau kau?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:13.83,0:20:15.67,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau sungguh menjengkelkan.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:15.92,0:20:20.42,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku ingin membunuh satu Momotaro\Nuntuk setiap temanku yang mati.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:20.92,0:20:23.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tidak butuh teman lain selain mereka.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:24.90,0:20:25.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,"Mereka"?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:26.64,0:20:28.01,dialog,,0,0,0,,Teman-teman?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:28.04,0:20:29.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Memelihara hatiku?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:29.82,0:20:31.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,Masa bodoh!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:31.92,0:20:33.34,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku mau pulang!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:35.88,0:20:39.09,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia marah-marah terus\Nsemenjak kita pulang dari Nerima.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:39.38,0:20:41.51,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mari kita juga turun.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:41.69,0:20:42.69,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:42.75,0:20:44.01,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku sangat kedinginan.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:44.03,0:20:45.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Biarkan aku pulang saja.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:45.89,0:20:46.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hagure.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:47.45,0:20:49.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau ada yang ingin kau sampaikan,\Nkatakan saja.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:49.59,0:20:51.59,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lakukan seribu squat sebelum turun.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:53.32,0:20:55.08,dialog,,0,0,0,,Siap! Dengan senang hati!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:55.39,0:20:57.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku akan membunuhnya.\NKubunuh dia. Kubunuh dia. Kubunuh dia.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:58.30,0:21:00.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku akan ikut berlatih bersamamu.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:00.87,0:21:02.37,dialog,,0,0,0,,Enyah sana.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:05.92,0:21:07.34,dialog,,0,0,0,,Terserah.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:08.16,0:21:10.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,Seandainya dengan berteman\Nkita bisa jadi lebih kuat,
Dialogue: 10,0:21:10.47,0:21:12.23,dialog,,0,0,0,,tak usah repot-repot berlatih keras.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:12.62,0:21:17.54,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kemampuan Shiki terus meningkat\Nkarena dia melawan banyak Momotaro.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:17.57,0:21:19.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pasti itu alasannya.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:19.87,0:21:22.49,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bukan karena punya teman.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:22.84,0:21:24.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,Yang kubutuhkan adalah pertarungan sungguhan.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:24.39,0:21:27.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Makin sering aku bertempur,\Nmakin besar kekuatanku.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:30.38,0:21:34.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jika terus berada di sini,\Naku tidak akan berkembang.
